        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RKI CK 725 Gibraltar T Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUniquely designed, the Gibraltar T-Knob is a modern take on the geometric pull. This kitchen cabinet knob is reminiscent of geodes and adds whimsy and style to any light weight door or drawer. The RKI CK 725 Gibraltar T Knob is available in several popular finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:<a href=\"/products/gibraltar-cabinet-pull-series-rk-international-cp-825\"><b>Matching Gibraltar Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/gibraltar-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-8825\"><b>Gibraltar Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Gibraltar Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
